Create Fly: Farmers Create

Based on FarmersCreate by ChefExperte, version 2.0 (tag v2.0, commit fa9ef8bf).
  Upstream source:  https://github.com/chefexperte/FarmersCreate
  Upstream project: https://modrinth.com/mod/farmerscreate
  This port:        https://github.com/chaevsfe/FarmersCreate

Modified by chaevsfe in 2026 to run on Minecraft 26.1.2 with the Fabric mod
loader, built against Create Fly by ZurrTum and Farmer's Delight Refabricated.

Nature of the modifications:
  - built against Create Fly 26.1.2 and Farmer's Delight Refabricated 26.1
  - Farmer's Delight recipe results read through the 26.x item stack templates
  - the recipe manager mixin applied once, from a single common mixin config
  - recipe counts logged at debug level instead of printed to standard output
  - the empty client, data generator and recipe provider classes removed

This is an unofficial port. It is not endorsed by or affiliated with the
original author. Please report problems with the port to this repository,
not to the upstream project.

Create Fly and Farmer's Delight Refabricated are separate projects with their
own licences; none of their code or assets are redistributed here.

